# counter/_websocket scope 900 — the opt-in close event.
#
# Because the accept op asked for `events = &array("close")`, the chassis
# runs this stack once more when the session ends — whoever ended it
# (`@websocket.close.initiated_by` is client, stack, or chassis; the code
# and reason ride beside it). Presence cleanup goes here.
WHEN @websocket.phase == "close"
  EXEC "txco://kv/delete"
  WITH key = &concat("count:", @websocket.session.id)
